    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>skins of young goats | the skin of a young roe-deer during its first year (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b), here dressed | the skin of a young roe-deer during its first year; the skin of such an animal (OED s.v. kid n.^1 1b), here white in color | skin of a young roe-deer during its first year (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) | a young roe-deer during its first year; the skin of such an animal (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) | the skin of a young roe-deer during its first year (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) | white in color | the skin of a young roe-deer during its first year; the skin of such an animal (OED s.v. kid n.^1 1b) | the skin of the young of a goat; a young roe-deer during its first year; the skin of such an animal (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) | the skin of a young roe-deer during its first year; the skin of such an animal (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) | skin of a young roe-deer during its first year (OED s.v. kid n.1 1b) (see also pellis de ked)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
